<script setup lang="ts">
import{computed,onMounted,ref}from'vue';import{getLongTermReview}from'../services/evaluationService';import type{LongTermReview}from'../types/evaluation'
const data=ref<LongTermReview|null>(null),weeks=ref(8),loading=ref(true),error=ref('');const maxLoad=computed(()=>Math.max(1,...(data.value?.timeline.map(x=>x.totalLoad)??[])));const date=(v:string)=>new Date(`${v}T12:00:00`).toLocaleDateString('es-AR',{day:'2-digit',month:'short'});const delta=(v:number|null,suffix='')=>v===null?'Sin comparación':`${v>0?'+':''}${v}${suffix}`;const hours=(minutes:number)=>Math.round(minutes/60*10)/10
async function load(){loading.value=true;error.value='';try{data.value=await getLongTermReview(weeks.value)}catch(e){error.value=e instanceof Error?e.message:'No se pudo abrir la evaluación.'}finally{loading.value=false}}onMounted(load)
</script>
<template><section class="page evaluation-page" :class="{muted:loading}"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Evaluación longitudinal</span><h1>Proceso de 4, 8 y 12 semanas</h1><p>Compara períodos de tu propia historia. Describe cambios registrados sin explicar automáticamente su causa.</p></div><div class="evaluation-period"><button v-for="n in [4,8,12]" :key="n" :class="{active:weeks===n}" @click="weeks=n;load()">{{n}} semanas</button></div></div><div v-if="error" class="notice error">{{error}}</div><template v-if="data"><div class="evaluation-coverage"><span>{{data.dataCoverageDays}} días con datos de {{data.weeks*7}}</span><i><b :style="{width:`${data.dataCoverageDays/(data.weeks*7)*100}%`}"></b></i><small>{{date(data.from)}} — {{date(data.to)}}</small></div><div class="evaluation-kpis"><article><span>Carga total</span><strong>{{data.summary.totalLoad}} UA</strong><small>{{delta(data.summary.loadChangePercent,'% entre mitades')}}</small></article><article><span>Promedio semanal</span><strong>{{data.summary.averageWeeklyLoad}} UA</strong><small>Entrenamiento + actividad cotidiana</small></article><article><span>Sesiones</span><strong>{{data.summary.sessions}}</strong><small>{{data.summary.trainingMinutes}} minutos de entrenamiento</small></article><article><span>Actividad cotidiana</span><strong>{{data.summary.activityMinutes}} min</strong><small>Trabajo, bicicleta y otras cargas</small></article><article><span>Cambio de fatiga</span><strong>{{delta(data.summary.fatigueChange,' pt')}}</strong><small>Segunda mitad frente a primera</small></article></div><article class="panel evaluation-work"><div><span class="eyebrow">Contexto laboral longitudinal</span><h2>Trabajo previsto y realizado</h2><p v-if="data.work.recordedDays">{{data.work.recordedDays}} jornadas comparables distribuidas en {{data.work.weeksWithData}} semana{{data.work.weeksWithData===1?'':'s'}}.</p><p v-else>Todavía no hay jornadas con una duración prevista guardada en este período.</p></div><div><article><span>Previsto</span><strong>{{hours(data.work.plannedMinutes)}} h</strong></article><article><span>Realizado</span><strong>{{hours(data.work.actualMinutes)}} h</strong></article><article :class="{attention:data.work.extraMinutes}"><span>Adicional</span><strong>{{hours(data.work.extraMinutes)}} h</strong></article><article><span>Diferencia neta</span><strong>{{data.work.differenceMinutes>0?'+':''}}{{data.work.differenceMinutes}} min</strong></article></div><div v-if="data.work.contextRecordedDays" class="evaluation-work-context"><span><strong>{{data.work.contextRecordedDays}}</strong> jornadas detalladas</span><span><strong>{{data.work.breakMinutes}}</strong> min de pausas informadas</span><span :class="{attention:data.work.unusualDays}"><strong>{{data.work.unusualDays}}</strong> días inusuales</span></div><footer>Se muestran hechos registrados. Las pausas informadas no equivalen automáticamente a recuperación y la coincidencia temporal con fatiga, dolor o rendimiento no prueba causalidad.</footer></article>
<div class="evaluation-grid"><article class="panel evaluation-chart"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Cronología semanal</span><h2>Carga por origen</h2></div><span class="evidence-chip">Bloques de 7 días</span></div><div class="evaluation-bars"><div v-for="(item,index) in data.timeline" :key="item.from"><span>{{item.totalLoad||''}}</span><div><i class="external" :style="{height:`${item.externalLoad/maxLoad*100}%`}"></i><i class="training" :style="{height:`${item.trainingLoad/maxLoad*100}%`}"></i><b v-if="item.kneeAttentionChecks" title="Control funcional de atención">!</b></div><small>S{{index+1}}</small></div></div><div class="weekly-legend"><span><i class="training"></i> Entrenamiento</span><span><i class="external"></i> Actividad cotidiana</span><span>! Rodilla</span></div></article><article class="panel evaluation-signals"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Lectura explicable</span><h2>Señales</h2></div></div><div class="signal-list"><div v-for="s in data.signals" :key="s.title" class="insight-signal" :class="s.kind"><span>{{s.kind==='attention'?'!':s.kind==='observe'?'↗':'i'}}</span><div><strong>{{s.title}}</strong><p>{{s.detail}}</p><small>{{s.basis}}</small></div></div></div></article></div>
<article class="panel evaluation-weeks"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Detalle</span><h2>Semana por semana</h2></div></div><div class="evaluation-week header"><span>Semana</span><span>Carga</span><span>Sesiones</span><span>Contexto</span><span>Trabajo</span><span>Fatiga</span><span>Dolor</span></div><div v-for="(item,index) in data.timeline" :key="item.from" class="evaluation-week"><strong>S{{index+1}}<small>{{date(item.from)}}–{{date(item.to)}}</small></strong><span>{{item.totalLoad}} UA<small>{{item.trainingLoad}} + {{item.externalLoad}}</small></span><span>{{item.sessions}}<small>{{item.trainingMinutes}} min</small></span><span>{{item.checkIns}} check-ins<small>{{item.activityMinutes}} min extra</small></span><span v-if="item.workRecordedDays">{{hours(item.workActualMinutes)}} / {{hours(item.workPlannedMinutes)}} h<small>{{item.workDifferenceMinutes>0?'+':''}}{{item.workDifferenceMinutes}} min netos · {{item.workExtraMinutes}} adicionales</small><small v-if="item.workContextRecordedDays">{{item.workBreakMinutes}} min pausas · {{item.workUnusualDays}} días inusuales</small></span><span v-else>—<small>Sin jornadas comparables</small></span><span>{{item.averageFatigue??'—'}} / 10</span><span>{{item.averagePain??'—'}} / 10</span></div></article>
<article class="panel evaluation-metrics"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Resultados medidos</span><h2>Indicadores con al menos dos registros</h2></div></div><div class="metric-evolution"><article v-for="metric in data.metrics" :key="metric.id"><div><strong>{{metric.name}}</strong><small>{{metric.entries}} registros · {{metric.direction}}</small></div><span>{{metric.firstValue}} {{metric.unit}}<small>{{date(metric.firstDate)}}</small></span><b>→</b><span>{{metric.latestValue}} {{metric.unit}}<small>{{date(metric.latestDate)}}</small></span><em :class="{positive:(metric.direction==='HigherIsBetter'&&metric.change>0)||(metric.direction==='LowerIsBetter'&&metric.change<0),negative:(metric.direction==='HigherIsBetter'&&metric.change<0)||(metric.direction==='LowerIsBetter'&&metric.change>0)}">{{metric.change>0?'+':''}}{{metric.change}} {{metric.unit}}</em></article><p v-if="!data.metrics.length" class="list-empty">Todavía no hay indicadores con dos mediciones dentro de este período.</p></div></article></template></section></template>
